# VanniKawachh F450 SITL parameters
# Hardware reference is DJI Flamewheel F450 + Pixhawk-class ArduCopter.
# Exact real-airframe tuning must be confirmed from the physical BOM before flight.

SIM_SPEEDUP 1
# This file is exclusively for the simulated vehicle.  Sensor-estimator
# readiness is exercised by the bridge, while disabling interactive pre-arm
# gates keeps unattended headless SITL runs deterministic.
ARMING_CHECK 0
# DJI Flamewheel F450: conventional four-motor X-frame. Both parameters are
# reboot-required in ArduCopter and prevent the unsupported-frame pre-arm fail.
FRAME_CLASS 1
FRAME_TYPE 1
WPNAV_SPEED 1000
WPNAV_ACCEL 250
WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR 1
RTL_ALT 1500
LAND_SPEED 50
DISARM_DELAY 5
SERVO9_FUNCTION 0
SERVO9_MIN 1100
SERVO9_MAX 1900
SERVO9_TRIM 1100
